---

<section class="highlight-area">
  <h1 class="title">mdohr.space</h1>

  <section class="intro-text" lang="en">
    <p>
      Welcome to this little outpost in the vast digital cosmos, traveler. One
      is an INFJ(A), a frontend crafter, an artist and a journal keeper who
      enjoys sci-fi and road cycling as well as a good strong black tea or
      coffee with some pastry.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is One's place to experiment, occasionally log their status or
      thoughts — not always deep — and in the future, you might well find
      projects and art here. If the mood strikes, it's a space for everything
      that comes to One’s mind.
    </p>
  </section>

    <RandomQuote />

</section>

